  m_text: "Iskandar Shah, the last king of Temasek, breaks a sacred oath established
    by Sang Nila Utama, the kingdom\u2019s founding king. His actions lead to the
    collapse of his kingdom. Unearthed on Fort Canning Hill, the exquisite gold Kala
    armlet reflects the wealth and status of the elite who lived in ancient Temasek,
    a settlement believed to have been ruled by a royal court. "
